title: Bachmann BlueNet2: PDU state
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/power/bachmann
license: GPLv2
distribution: kuhn-ruess
description:
 Monitors the state of every PDU (master and slaves) of a Bachmann BlueNet2
 daisy chain, as reported by the master in its device table.

 {on}, {ok} are {OK}. {expected} (the master knows the PDU, but cannot
 reach it), {off}, {lost}, the alarm and error states are {CRIT}, the
 warning states are {WARN}, unknown states are {UNKNOWN}. A PDU that
 vanished from the device table is {CRIT} as well.

item:
 The name of the PDU, e.g. {Master} or {Slave-1}.

discovery:
 One service per PDU. The service label {device_friendly_name} holds the
 friendly name of the PDU.
